{"wikiPageId":1402633,"title":"関孝和","genre":"Q5","wikiRevisionId":111475535,"wikiFetchedAt":"2026-11-04T09:25:02.891Z","summary":"関 孝和 は、日本の江戸時代前期の和算家（数学者）、武士、甲府藩士のち旗本。本姓は藤原氏（結城一族）。内山氏の生まれで、関氏の養子となった。通称は新助。字は子豹、号は自由亭。算聖と称される。","imageUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0f/Seki.jpeg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","imageCredit":"upload by AMorozov・Public domain（Wikimedia Commons）","rarity":"legendary","monthlyPageviews":49882,"pageviewsMeasuredAt":"2026-11-04T09:25:02.891Z","isActive":true}
